    "date": "2026-10-27",
    "decision": "Keep existing hardware-only HEVC; no software decoder integration or Electron rebuild for this update.",
    "reason": "A system libde265 adapter is technically plausible and LGPLv3 has a shared-library route, but project-specific HEVC patent clearance was not established. User requested the new implementation only if licensing conditions could be met.",
    "local_build_policy": "If a future candidate build is needed for this task, only this candidate on the user's PC; preserve retained objects and verified runtime; no CI compiler or publication.",
    "system_packages": {
