      "ffmpeg": "2:9.0.2-2.1 (GPL-3.0-only)"
    },
    "technical_findings": [
      "FFmpegVideoDecoder::IsCodecSupported accepts only H.264 in the retained source.",
      "The FFmpeg thread-selection switch treats HEVC as unsupported.",
      "Linux HEVC capability reporting uses available platform decoder profiles.",
      "Chromium provides a system FFmpeg GN target, but swapping libffmpeg.so is not sufficient and custom OpenH264 symbols must remain compatible.",
      "System libde265 has a public C API and Main/Main 10 support, but Chromium needs a decoder adapter, capability integration and sandbox-safe loading."
    ],
